# the pressure gestures (v0.3): keys 9-12 (G4 .. C5, w8 .. w11) play Tick, Chord, Snarl, Stutter on every bank,
# each the partner of the top key four to its right. Held, one goes toward how hard the key is pressed, over its
# time (6.5 s at Gesture time 50); easing off, it comes back; let go, back to none. A tap latches it at 100; tapping
# a latched one lets it go. SEL tapped while one is held latches it where it has got to (gamN: gesture N x 100;
# heard42 cross-mod, heard43 its amount, heard55 the Swell). The scenes play keys 1-8.
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w10 0
pressure w11 0
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
# B4 (Snarl) pressed half way: in toward ~50 %, the Snarl on (its mode, a switch, at the first touch)
key w10 down
pressure w10 70
wait 3000
expect gam6 >30
expect heard42 3
wait 4000
expect gam6 >50
expect gam6 <62
# pressed hard: on in
pressure w10 127
wait 7000
expect gam6 100
expect heard43 85
# eased off: back toward the press
pressure w10 40
wait 7000
expect gam6 <35
# let go: out
pressure w10 0
key w10 up
wait 7000
expect gam6 0
expect heard42 0
# a tap latches C5 (Stutter) all the way: the Swell on, fast; a tap lets it go
key w11 down
wait 100
key w11 up
wait 7000
expect gam7 100
expect par107 100
expect heard55 1
key w11 down
wait 100
key w11 up
wait 7000
expect gam7 0
expect par107 0
# SEL tapped while G4 (Tick) is held: latched where it got to, and let go it stays
key w8 down
pressure w8 127
wait 3300
press SEL
release SEL
pressure w8 0
key w8 up
wait 3000
expect par104 >40
expect par104 <60
expect gam4 >40
# ... and the same on a top key (Weight, D5): SEL tapped while held, kept
key w12 down
wait 1400
press SEL
release SEL
key w12 up
wait 3000
expect par90 >30
expect par90 <70
# the scene keys are 1-8: SAVE + key 9 doesn't store, it's a gesture (A4, Chord)
press SEL
tapkey w12
release SEL
press SAVE
key w9 down
pressure w9 127
wait 1000
key w9 up
release SAVE
wait 300
expect scenes 0
